{"title":"Tech's newest evil main character","link":"https://www.usermag.co/p/the-latest-evil-tech-main-character-who-is-sequoia-shaun-maguire-silicon-valley","date":1751907181000,"content":"<p>At 10:00am ET on July 4th, while most people were preparing for Fourth of July festivities, <a href=\"https://x.com/shaunmmaguire\">Shaun Maguire</a>, a multi millionaire general partner at Sequoia Capital, the most esteemed venture capital firm in Silicon Valley, was rage tweeting about the “Death of the West.”</p><p><a href=\"https://x.com/shaunmmaguire/status/1941135110922969168\">He posted on X</a>; \"[Zohran] Mamdani comes from a culture that lies about everything. It’s literally a virtue to lie if it advances his Islamist agenda. The West will learn this lesson the hard way.\"</p><p>Anti-Muslim hate is becoming extremely profitable in Silicon Valley as the tech industry pivots towards defense tech and embedding itself with the U.S. war machine. From funding Israeli defense startups to spreading racist conspiracy theories about Zohran Mamdani, VCs like Maguire are pushing a new brand of tech militarism. </p><p>Defense tech, AI surveillance, and far-right pro-Trump ideologies are merging in the tech world as Silicon Valley’s obsession with profit fuels a dangerous new era of \"the war on terror 2.0.\" In <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vKSKawpFsfs&amp;t=1s\">my latest video</a>, I dig into how Shaun Maguire is playing a leading role in this new landscape, and how VCs like him are building a future defined by endless war. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vKSKawpFsfs&amp;t=1s\">Watch here</a>! </p><div><div></div></div><div><div><div><p>User Mag is a 100% reader-supported publication. To receive new posts and support my work, become a free or paid subscriber.</p></div><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div><h2>What I’m reading</h2><div></div><p><strong>Blake Lively vs. the ‘Misogyny Slop Ecosystem’</strong></p><p>“We are in a culture that rewards misogynistic thinking that is baked into everybody” - <em><a href=\"https://archive.ph/2025.07.07-094653/https://www.nytimes.com/2025/07/07/opinion/blake-lively-justin-baldoni-harassment.html#selection-765.0-765.87\">New York Times</a></em></p><p><strong>She Wanted to Save the World From A.I. Then the Killings Started.</strong> </p><p>At first, Ziz LaSota seemed much like any other philosophically inclined young tech aspirant. Now, she and her followers are in jail, six people are dead, and Rationalists are examining whether their ideas played a role. - <em>New York Times</em></p><p><strong>How tech’s most prolific scammer duped 19 startups into hiring him</strong> </p><p>All over Silicon Valley, companies are realizing they hired the same gifted coder, often at the same time. - <em><a href=\"https://sfstandard.com/2025/07/04/engineer-scams-tech-startups/\">SF Standard</a></em></p><p><strong>Brain Freeze</strong></p><p>The idea of cryonics — freezing the bodies of the dead in the hopes that they can one day be revived — has existed since the 1960s. We’ve since learned that perfect preservation is much, much harder than any of its founders anticipated. - <em><a href=\"https://asteriskmag.com/issues/10/brain-freeze\">Asterisk Mag</a></em></p><p><strong>Once it was mostly a taco website. Now it’s covering L.A. ICE raids.</strong> </p><p>L.A. Taco has become a formidable media outlet amid the Trump administration’s immigration crackdown and the resulting protests. - <em><a href=\"https://archive.ph/54Hu3#selection-267.0-271.128\">Washington Post</a></em></p><p><strong>Maga influencer and de facto national security adviser Laura Loomer holds outsized sway on Trump</strong></p><p>The 32-year-old was instrumental in high-profile national security firings, and has cheerled the attacks on Iran. - <em><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/jul/06/laura-loomer-donald-trump-maga-influencer\">The Guardian</a></em></p><p><strong>Making America Healthy again is women’s work</strong></p><p>Nostalgia for the myth of the happy housewife. - <em><a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/numbertwopencil/p/making-america-healthy-again-is-womens?r=9ce09&amp;utm_medium=ios\">Number Two Pencil</a></em></p><p><strong>Inside the Media’s Traffic Apocalypse</strong></p><p>Traffic headwinds are not exactly a new problem for media companies, but it has only gotten worse. - <em><a href=\"https://www.msn.com/en-us/news/opinion/inside-the-media-s-traffic-apocalypse/ar-AA1I7iR4\">New York Magazine</a></em></p><p><strong>The Subtly Unsettling Logic of This Prize-Winning A.I. Film</strong></p><p>Does A.I. filmmaking unlock the deepest secrets of reality? - <em><a href=\"https://news.artnet.com/art-world/total-pixel-space-jacob-adler-a-i-film-festival-2662774\">Artnet</a></em></p><p><strong>Systems are crumbling – but daily life continues. The dissonance is real.</strong></p><p>If everything feels broken but strangely normal, the Soviet-era concept of hypernormalization can help - <em><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/wellness/ng-interactive/2025/may/22/hypernormalization-dysfunction-status-quo\">The Guardian</a></em></p><p><a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/p/the-latest-evil-tech-main-character-who-is-sequoia-shaun-maguire-silicon-valley?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share&amp;token=eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoxMTMxMTk5NywicG9zdF9pZCI6MTY3Njg2NzMzLCJpYXQiOjE3NTM3MzMzNzQsImV4cCI6MTc1NjMyNTM3NCwiaXNzIjoicHViLTMyMzgiLCJzdWIiOiJwb3N0LXJlYWN0aW9uIn0.0Q0VzBDgHJVv2Lqw3P26k5xc1x7UMgNXsYMnK5BDqp0\"><span>Share</span></a></p><h2>User Mag news rundown</h2><ul><li><p>TikTok is working on <a href=\"https://www.theinformation.com/articles/tiktok-building-new-version-app-ahead-expected-u-s-sale\">a new app designed specifically for U.S. users</a>, set to launch on September 5th. The company plans to shut down the current version by March 2026.</p></li><li><p>A Maine police department <a href=\"https://x.com/memeindustrial/status/1940089152407838939?s=46&amp;t=qjmdupmcsZXWJHQY5AyzUQ\">posted AI slop of a drug bust</a> then tried to delete it after getting called out. </p></li><li><p>Dr Phil’s <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/tv-movies/does-dr-phil-still-have-show-merit-tv-network-bankruptcy-3222719/\">“Anti-woke” TV network has folded</a> and filed for bankruptcy. </p></li><li><p>Now you can turn your airplane <a href=\"https://www.rollingstone.com/culture/culture-features/bald-baby-jd-vance-meme-boarding-pass-app-1235378689/\">boarding pass into the bald J.D. Vance meme</a>. </p></li><li><p>Grok has started to <a href=\"https://x.com/esjesjesj/status/1941749464634425454?t=7AFdnLxUHJHfz1quZJmtnw&amp;s=19\">reply in first person</a> as Elon and claims to have visited Epstein’s house(!?)</p></li><li><p>Skinny little mustaches <a href=\"https://www.gq.com/story/skinny-mustache-facial-hair-style\">are IN this summer</a>. </p></li><li><p>Not a lot of <a href=\"https://news.gallup.com/poll/692150/american-pride-slips-new-low.aspx\">Americans are proud</a> to be American anymore.</p></li><li><p>Bosses are <a href=\"https://www.fastcompany.com/91357784/what-is-a-micro-retirement-inside-the-latest-gen-z-trend\">trying to rebrand vacation</a> as “micro retirement”</p></li><li><p>AI-generated videos are taking over YouTube. A Short of “Baby Mistakenly Flies Plane” was the <a href=\"https://x.com/TrungTPhan/status/1940905807908110711\">3rd most-watched on the platform</a> last week with ~130m views.</p></li><li><p>Labubu has <a href=\"https://archive.ph/2025.06.25-211132/https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2025-06-25/labubu-s-biggest-threat-is-not-wakuku-or-lafufu\">made its parent company Pop Mart worth</a> more than Barbie and Hello Kitty.</p></li><li><p>A new toxic metal has been found in the air after L.A. fires. <a href=\"https://www.sfchronicle.com/california-wildfires/article/los-angeles-fires-beryllium-20383289.php\">No one knows where it’s coming from</a>.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>There are <a href=\"https://archive.is/2025.07.01-235958/https://www.nytimes.com/2025/06/30/well/mind/cool-people-traits-study.html#selection-725.0-729.195\">six specific traits that make people seem cool</a>. You have to be: extroverted, hedonistic, powerful, adventurous, open and autonomous, according to a new study.</p></li><li><p>Driving around in <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DLoAOmTp2Y7/\">the Labubu car</a> could heal me… </p></li><li><p>Trumpworld is going wild over a new FBI report that supposedly proves China stole the election. (<a href=\"https://www.thebulwark.com/p/youll-never-believe-where-kash-patel-election-fraud-bombshell-wray\">Spoiler: it does not</a>).</p></li><li><p>Trump announced there will be <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DLq7kgVPJVG/?igsh=MTBrbWh3d2JmdGkydQ%3D%3D\">a UFC fight on the White House lawn</a> next year.</p></li><li><p>Why mom is coming on the honeymoon: Newlyweds are <a href=\"https://www.wsj.com/lifestyle/relationships/familymoon-honeymoon-in-laws-39842b0b\">inviting their in-laws on postwedding trips</a>, saying there will be plenty of other time for passion. </p></li><li><p>Nearly half of America’s murderers <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2025/07/06/us/murder-solve-rate-louisville.html?unlocked_article_code=1.UU8.LbXM.ICjC_SRSkoKD&amp;smid=url-share\">get away with it</a>.</p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.fastcompany.com/91362947/napster-is-back-betting-big-on-ai\">Napster is back</a>—and it’s betting big on holographic avatars.</p></li><li><p>Love Island contestant Elan Bibas <a href=\"https://archive.ph/zE13w#selection-1559.0-1574.1\">tapped his brother to run his Instagram</a> while he was on TV, and his following skyrocketed. </p><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DLwDG11RjLJ/\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MeVu!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdc562695-6d6f-425b-875a-7664f8581352_749x900.jpeg\" width=\"266\" height=\"319.6261682242991\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MeVu!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdc562695-6d6f-425b-875a-7664f8581352_749x900.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MeVu!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdc562695-6d6f-425b-875a-7664f8581352_749x900.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MeVu!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdc562695-6d6f-425b-875a-7664f8581352_749x900.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MeVu!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdc562695-6d6f-425b-875a-7664f8581352_749x900.jpeg 1456w\" loading=\"lazy\" /><div></div></div></a><figcaption>Is Wakuku the next Labubu??</figcaption></figure></div></li><li><p>People are <a href=\"https://www.valueaddedresource.net/etsy-boycott-alligator-alcatraz-merch/\">threatening to boycott Etsy</a> for allowing sales of <a href=\"https://www.distractify.com/p/alligator-alcatraz-merch\">Alligator Alcatraz merch.</a></p></li><li><p>Tesla investors <a href=\"https://www.telegraph.co.uk/business/2025/07/07/tesla-shares-sink-as-donald-trump-calls-musk-a-train-wreck/\">are exhausted.</a> </p></li><li><p>Far-right extremists are exploiting TikTok’s “use-this-sound” feature <a href=\"https://www.fastcompany.com/91362944/heres-how-far-right-extremists-hide-in-tiktoks-earworms\">as a Trojan horse for hate speech</a>.</p></li><li><p>Peter Thiel and Palmer Luckey are launching <a href=\"https://archive.ph/hpCsk\">a new bank called Erebor</a>, after a Lord of the Rings character. </p></li><li><p>Los Angeles is halting hundreds of of ‘disaster tourists’ <a href=\"https://archive.is/zm6mb#selection-2459.0-2472.3\">arriving on busses through Palisades fire zone</a>.</p></li><li><p>Cinnamon Toast Crunch <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/food/cinnamon-toast-crunch-reveals-new-bacon-flavored-breakfast-cereal-3223332/\">reveals new bacon-flavored breakfast cereal</a>.</p></li><li><p>MAGA influencers <a href=\"https://www.axios.com/2025/07/07/jeffrey-epstein-trump-maga-patel-bongino\">are melting down</a> after the Trump administration concluded that Jeffrey Epstein had not blackmailed elite figures, kept a \"client list\" or was murdered in prison.</p></li><li><p>When <a href=\"https://x.com/kenklippenstein/status/1941978345463304331\">asked about Elon Musk's America Party</a>, Trump said: \"He can have fun with it but I think it's ridiculous.\"</p></li><li><p>Inside the <a href=\"https://archive.is/EjgHt#selection-1895.0-1898.0\">‘neurohacking’ camp</a> that promises worldly bliss in five days<sup>.</sup></p></li><li><p>Netflix is <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/anime/survey-claims-netflix-biggest-anime-streaming-platform-problem-crunchyroll-3222211/\">now the biggest anime streaming platform</a>.</p></li><li><p>Robots are <a href=\"https://futurism.com/robots-outnumber-humans-amazon-warehouses\">about to outnumber humans</a> at Amazon warehouses.</p></li><li><p>How <a href=\"https://www.dazeddigital.com/music/article/68168/1/how-nia-ivy-went-from-tiktok-parodies-to-pop-stardom-nicki-minaj-barbz\">Nia Ivy went from TikTok parodies</a> to pop stardom.</p></li><li><p>AT&amp;T wouldn’t allow sponsors at Essence Fest to <a href=\"https://x.com/theroyalbadness/status/1941476487049441757\">say anything negative about AI.</a> </p></li><li><p>Elon Musk formally announced the launch of <a href=\"https://www.reuters.com/world/us/musk-says-america-party-is-formed-us-2025-07-05/\">“The America Party” his new political party.</a></p></li><li><p>AI generated music is starting to <a href=\"https://futurism.com/ai-music-lofi-streaming\">crowd out the real stuff</a> on streaming apps.</p></li><li><p>Instead of relying on celebrities, <a href=\"https://archive.ph/oe1fz#selection-489.0-489.109\">brands are hiring in-house social creators</a> (this has been going on for 15 years but everything old is new again!)</p></li><li><p>Companies are getting <a href=\"https://www.wsj.com/lifestyle/careers/job-listings-labor-market-373b4331\">brutally honest with applicants</a>, warning them of long hours and few boundaries.</p></li><li><p>Construction begins on <a href=\"https://www.independent.co.uk/travel/news-and-advice/new-york-city-floating-pool-east-river-b2781334.html\">a floating swimming pool in NYC</a>. The attraction, called \"+ Pool\", will measure 9,000 sq ft and be accessible from a walkway by Pier 35 on the East River.</p></li><li><p>SpaceX is facing <a href=\"https://futurism.com/spacex-sued-again-sexual-harassment\">yet another sexual harassment lawsuit</a>.</p></li><li><p>A drug dealer got caught <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/entertainment/drug-dealer-gets-caught-dealing-in-court-to-another-defendant-3222762/\">dealing drugs in court</a> to another defendant.</p></li><li><p>Grok <a href=\"https://www.thedailybeast.com/elon-musks-ai-robot-blames-trump-and-its-own-creator-for-texas-flooding-deaths/\">is blaming Musk and Trump</a> for Texas flooding deaths.</p></li><li><p>Bosses are <a href=\"https://futurism.com/managers-using-ai-fire\">using AI to decide who to fire.</a> </p></li><li><p>Kai Cenat has an <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/twitch/kai-cenats-amp-summer-house-has-one-of-only-50-nandos-in-whole-us-3221764/\">official Nando’s chicken shop location</a> in his summer house. </p></li><li><p>SYFM is taking over TikTok comments, it means <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/tiktok/what-does-syfm-mean-on-tiktok-viral-slang-term-explained-3222386/\">shut your fucking mouth</a>. </p></li><li><p>Influencers are <a href=\"https://archive.ph/2025.07.03-120652/https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-07-03/influencers-urged-to-avoid-politics-during-immigration-crackdown#selection-1155.0-1160.0\">being told to steer clear of mentioning politics</a> amidst U.S. immigration crackdown.</p></li><li><p>Love Island’s Season Seven bombshell Cierra Ortega has been <a href=\"https://www.rollingstone.com/tv-movies/tv-movie-news/love-island-removes-cierra-ortega-racial-slur-posts-1235379583/\">removed from the villa</a> after a video of her saying a racial slur surfaced. </p></li><li><p>‘Mewing’ creator John Mew <a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/tiktok/mewing-creator-john-mew-dead-at-96-years-old-3221791/\">has died at 96-years-old</a>.</p></li><li><p>Tiny Chef creators reveal the show got cancelled from Nickelodeon (<a href=\"https://www.dexerto.com/tv-movies/tiny-chef-creators-reveal-why-nickelodeon-canceled-beloved-show-despite-emmy-win-3220458/\">because of bad timing with the merger</a>).</p></li></ul><p><a href=\"https://www.usermag.co/p/the-latest-evil-tech-main-character-who-is-sequoia-shaun-maguire-silicon-valley?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share&amp;token=eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoxMTMxMTk5NywicG9zdF9pZCI6MTY3Njg2NzMzLCJpYXQiOjE3NTM3MzMzNzQsImV4cCI6MTc1NjMyNTM3NCwiaXNzIjoicHViLTMyMzgiLCJzdWIiOiJwb3N0LXJlYWN0aW9uIn0.0Q0VzBDgHJVv2Lqw3P26k5xc1x7UMgNXsYMnK5BDqp0\"><span>Share</span></a></p><h2>Good posts</h2><div><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!o_FT!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F196acfab-9891-4b0f-acc8-b6d192e4ac17_1179x455.jpeg\"><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!o_FT!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F196acfab-9891-4b0f-acc8-b6d192e4ac17_1179x455.jpeg\" width=\"520\" height=\"200.6785411365564\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!o_FT!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_a